meta {
  name: Get Mentorship Sessions
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # Get Mentorship Sessions
  Get scheduled and completed mentorship 1-on-1 sessions.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - Sessions list returned.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  [
    {
      "id": "ses_1",
      "mentorName": "Dr. Ramesh Sundaram",
      "startupName": "BharatMed HealthTech",
      "scheduledAt": "2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "meetingLink": "https://meet.google.com/xyz-abc-def"
    }
  ]
  ```
}
